    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's so quiet when I think about it like that. A clean answer. No more noise, no more pretending I have a reason to wake up tomorrow. I look at the steel and I wonder if this is how the story is supposed to end. Is it wrong to want the story to just be over?",
